].prompt#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"雄蛙【　】，吸引【　】","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[5].blanks[0].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"發出嘓嘓嘓的叫聲","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[5].blanks[1].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"雌蛙","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[6].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"3.找五色鳥重要細節：第三段","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[7].paragraphs[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"❶春天來臨，住在枯木洞裡的五色鳥，開始粉墨登場，準備在演唱會上一展歌喉。❷牠身穿綠衣裳，頭戴彩色帽，站在茂密枝葉搭起的舞台上，揭開演唱會的序幕。❸五色鳥發出喀、喀、喀喀喀喀……的求偶叫聲，盡情的歌唱。❹牠獨特的聲音吸引愛慕者，為繁衍後代做準備。","n":122,"ssz":"...............................2..........1..............................................................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[7].note","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"⚠️ 這裡引用課文第三段時寫「舞台上」，課文原文是「舞臺上」。照各自原樣記錄。","n":39,"ssz":"......................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[8].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(1)找重要細節：哪兩句能直接說明五色鳥怎麼用歌聲求偶？","n":28,"ssz":"............................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[8].options.4","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"句❹","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[9].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(2)精簡句子：把兩句合起來，保留「誰＋怎麼做＋作用」\n五色鳥【　】。","n":35,"ssz":"......1............................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[9].prompt#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"(2)精簡句子：把兩句合起來，保留「誰＋怎麼做＋作用」","n":27,"ssz":"......1...................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[9].prompt#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"五色鳥【　】。","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[9].blanks[0].answer","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"發出喀、喀、喀喀喀的求偶叫聲，吸引愛慕者","n":20,"ssz":"...................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].items[10].prompt","s